  "content": "\n\n<p>英文：</p>\n<p>此插件通过向<strong>Apocalypse Structures: Radio Towers and Airdrops</strong>的结构中添加来自<strong>Doomsday Decorations</strong>的装饰物，对其进行了扩展。<br>它借助<strong>Berezka API for Radio Towers and Airdrops</strong>实现了无缝集成，为末世世界增添了更多氛围与多样性。</p>\n<p>🔧 <strong>所需模组：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-radio-towers-and-airdrops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka 无线电塔与空投 API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apocalypse-structures-radio-towers-and-airdrops\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日结构：无线电塔与空投</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration/files/6116037/dependencies\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日装饰</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>💬 加入 Discord 服务器以获取更新、反馈与建议：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>俄文：</p>\n<p>此插件扩展了<strong>Apocalypse Structures: Radio Towers and Airdrops</strong>模组，向其结构中加入了来自<strong>Doomsday Decorations</strong>的装饰物。<br>借助<strong>Berezka API for Radio Towers and Airdrops</strong>，这些装饰物能自然融入游戏世界，使其更具氛围感与多样性。</p>\n<p>🔧 <strong>所需模组：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-radio-towers-and-airdrops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka 无线电塔与空投 API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apocalypse-structures-radio-towers-and-airdrops\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日结构：无线电塔与空投</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration/files/6116037/dependencies\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日装饰</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>💬 加入我们的 Discord 服务器或 Telegram 频道，以追踪更新、报告错误并提出建议：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p>",
